\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of Director-CenterNet. The stacked game-state tensor is processed by a ResNet-FPN backbone. The heatmap head produces a dense score map over all candidate region centres, and ranked multi-peak extraction yields an ordered set of regions in a single forward pass. Training is supervised by the ranked modes of the aggregated observer distribution (Section~\ref {subsec:modes}): the Top-1 mode supervises the primary region and the remaining modes supervise the auxiliary regions.}}{9}{}\protected@file@percent }
